 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The potential form",
     "texto": [
      "To say you **can** do something, group 1 verbs change the last letter to **e** and add **る**: **はなす** → **はなせる** (can speak), **かく** → **かける** (can write).",
      "Group 2 verbs change **る** to **られる**: **たべる** → **たべられる** (can eat). With ます: **はなせます**, **たべられます**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The irregular verbs",
     "texto": [
      "**する** → **できる** (can do). **くる** → **こられる** (can come).",
      "What you can do takes the particle **が**: **にほんご が はなせます** (I can speak Japanese). Remember it's **が**, not **を**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
